<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 19/20.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS JUNE 19/20.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for June</p>
<p>19/20. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	   June 19/20	June 18/19</p>
<p> CZK	0.4309	   0.428</p>
<p> DKK	2.1011	   2.10071</p>
<p> FIM	2.6723	   2.67655</p>
<p> HUF	0.07457	  0.07454</p>
<p> JPY	0.12225	  0.12161</p>
<p> LTL	3.46173	  3.4491</p>
<p> LVL     24.26641	 24.20209</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	   0.00239</p>
<p> SEK	1.79104	  1.79245</p>
<p> UAH	7.47117	  7.44343</p>
<p> USD     13.8452	  13.7964</p>
<p> XEU     15.65338	 15.64029</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
